*** Creating network
*** Adding controller
*** Adding hosts:
h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 
*** Adding switches:
s0 s1 s2 s3 
*** Adding links:
(h0, s0) (h0, s2) (h1, s1) (h1, s2) (h2, s0) (h2, s2) (h3, s0) (h3, s2) (h3, s3) (h4, s0) (h4, s1) (h4, s2) 
*** Configuring hosts
h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 
*** Starting controller
c0 
*** Starting 4 switches
s0 s1 s2 s3 ...
*** Waiting for switches to connect
s0 s1 s2 s3 
